# Files first

- Do not run `npx praxis`, mutation hooks, workbench, or sqlite Work commands.
- Track target authority under `Docs/Evidence/<target>/`; use optional local `Docs/NOW.md` for status. Product truth is `Docs/PRODUCT.md` and specs.
- Treat `Docs/System/` as frozen history except for `Docs/System/Templates/phase.md`; never execute
  its old commands, protocols, derive/dashboard, close, or publish path.
- Implement in `apps/web/`, `packages/`, and `content/`. Prove with tests or the app.
- Follow `Docs/CLOSE.md` for candidate-pinned checks and independent audit sub-agents.
- Stay in this session. For a phase, coordinate and delegate coding by area to in-session
  sub-agents; do not start another agent runner to satisfy Praxis.
